Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:45:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Drive the pointer with a game controller on the PS5

GamepadPointer moves the real mouse pointer with the left stick and the touchpad (a stroke
across the touchpad crosses the window), and sends ordinary mouse button events for Cross (left)
and Square (right); a touchpad click is a left click too, and holding Circle moves the pointer
faster. Everything else then works as with a mouse. On the PS5 the right stick takes over the
analogue map scrolling.
